Hello Roxygeners,

Is there a roxygen tag that corresponds to the NAMESPACE directive
useDynLib(libname)?

Or, is there a way to have a NAMESPACE base file to which the roxygen
directives can be appended.  Such a base file might contain any
nonsupported directives.  This would be a workaround until a useDynLib
tag is available.

Thanks!
Ian

